items.description:
Build your first web page from an empty folder with HTML and CSS, step by step for complete beginners. No experience and nothing to install except a free text editor: you'll make a profile page with a round photo, a hover button, cards side by side with flexbox, and a layout that works on phones. Every page you see in the browser is a real screenshot of exactly the code on screen.

