‹html lang="en"›
‹head›
  ‹meta charset="UTF-8"›
  ‹meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"›
  ‹title›Sam Rivera‹/title›
  ‹link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"›
‹/head›
